'''Castle and Dragon Assault!''' (強襲！城とドラゴン, ''Kyōshū！ Shiro to Doragon'', '''Assault! Castle and Dragon''') is a [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event|Castle & Dragon]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 11.2 Update]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features many enemies from the collab.

==Overview==
===About===
Castle and Dragon Assault! contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''攻城戦 Lv.''' (攻城戦 Lv.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available).  Rewards for the first completion of a stage can include XP, [[Battle Items]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Catfruit]], [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]] and [[Leadership]]s. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Castle and Dragon Assault!/Siege Battle Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Castle and Dragon Assault! is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

